>> hex := Imiterere gishya: ['%x'].

# write 10
Ibisohoka andika: Hx xA, umurongo-mushya.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Umubare bigeze: ['as-hex'] kora: { <- hex shyira-kuri-umubare-wuzuye: ubwacyo.
}.

# write
Ibisohoka andika: Hx xA as-hex, umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: Hx xFF as-hex, umurongo-mushya.